<title>EGYPT: Egyptian president has first grandchild.</title>
<headline>Egyptian president has first grandchild.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak, 68, has become a grandfather, newspapers said on Saturday.</p>
<p>Heidi, the wife of Mubarak's elder son Alaa, gave birth to a baby boy on Friday, they said.</p>
<p>Alaa Mubarak, a businessman, is in his late 30s.</p>
</text>
